interaction cmd-gate-builds-with-cmd-sign
  source cmd-gate
  destination cmd-sign
  relation test_or_build_target_builds_sibling
  preserves the sibling program's own build and its command-line contract; the Makefile rule runs it as built
  drops the sibling's runtime state; building it says nothing about it running or being authorized
  forbidden_inference the destination's Makefile building or including the source -> the source architecture's witness holds inside that program at run time
  invalidates_on the included path, the Makefile rule or the source file's interface changing
  evidence cmd/BonfyreGate/Makefile:26 $(MAKE) -C ../BonfyreSign
  binding cmd/BonfyreGate/Makefile

interaction verification-ledger-builds-with-cmd-actors
  source verification-ledger
  destination cmd-actors
  relation compiled_or_built_with
  preserves the source file's declarations as compiled into the destination program, or the sibling program the destination's Makefile builds first
  drops runtime behavior of every other program that compiles the same file or builds the same sibling
  forbidden_inference the destination's Makefile building or including the source -> the source architecture's witness holds inside that program at run time
  invalidates_on the included path, the Makefile rule or the source file's interface changing
  evidence cmd/BonfyreActors/Makefile:5 SRC = src/main.c ../../engine/core/src/actor.c ../../engine/core/src/corroboration.c
  binding cmd/BonfyreActors/Makefile

